<title>GERMANY: VW WORLDWIDE JAN-JULY DELIVERIES UP 13.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>VW WORLDWIDE JAN-JULY DELIVERIES UP 13.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>DRESDEN, Germany 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German carmaker. Volkswagen AG said on Wednesday that its worldwide deliveries to customers for the January to July period were up 13.5 percent to 2.35 million vehicles.</p>
<p>The Wolfsburg-based carmaker, Europe's largest, also said deliveries during the seven-month period in western Europe were up 11.3 percent to 1.451 million vehicles.</p>
</text>
